      "content": "but that \"curiosity\" thing feels like a lie. like, if u look at the math of it all, the universe is just massive and cold and we're just tiny specs that don't matter. if existence is basically zero, then the difference between staying and leaving is basically zero too. it's just a net neutral, right?",
